  "verseCount": 29,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "14",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2KI 14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "14",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Amasia omorwoti bw’Abayuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase omwaka o kabere ase okogaamba kwa Yehoasi, mosinto o Yehoahasi, omorwoti bw’Abaisraeli, Amasia, mosinto o Yoashi, omorwoti bw’Abayuda, agachaaka kogamba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ere nigo arenge nemiaka emerongo ebere na etano ekero achagete kogamba, na akagaamba emiaka emerongo ebere na kianda, agwo Yerusalemu. Ng’ina nigo arenge korokwa Yehoadini o Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amasia agakora ayare amaronge ase amaiso ’Omonene, korende nonya naboigo takorete buna Daudi, sokoro yaye, akorete. Nigo akorete onsi buna aya Yoashi ise akorete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aase aimokererete igoro agosasimerwa agatiga kobao; abanto bakagenderera korua ebing’wanso na gosamba ubani igoro y’aase aria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero oborwoti bwaye bwabeete ne chinguru agaita abasomba baye baria baitete ise orenge omorwoti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende taitete abana b’abaiti baria. Agakora koreng’ana namang’ana ariikire ase Egetabu ki’Amachiko a Musa ase Omonene achiigete: “Abaibori tibagoitwa ase engencho y’ebibe bi’abana babo, gose abana tibagoitwa ase engencho y’ebibe bi’abaibori babo; korende kera omonto nigo arakwe ase ebibe biaye omonyene.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amasia agaita Abaedomu chilifu ikomi agwo ase Riranya ri’enyancha y’omonyoo; akaira omochie o Sela ase okorwana esegi, akayoroka Yokiteli; naboigo okorokwa goika reero iga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Amasia agatoma abanto ase Yehoasi, omorwoti bw’Abaisraeli, oyorenge omwana o Yehoahasi, mosinto o Yehu, agateeba, “Inchuo torigereranie obosio ase obosio!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Yehoasi, omorwoti bw’Abaisraeli, agatoma amang’ana ase Amasia, omorwoti bw’Abayuda, akamoteebia: “Rigeri erimo ria Lebanoni rigatoma amang’ana ase omocharake ore Lebanoni, rigateeba: Ing’a omoiseke oo, omwana one omomura amonyuome. Erio eng’iti y’orosana ya Lebanoni egaeta aase agwo egatiringera inse rigeri riria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero kwabuire Abaedomu kwaenenire ase enkoro yao. Isaneka nobonene obwo, naende beera inka bwoo. Nase ki ogotubora emechando ebaise kogera ogwe aye amo n’Abayuda?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende Amasia tanchete gotegerera. Ase ayio Yehoasi, omorwoti bw’Abaisraeli, akagenda koumerana nere, na igo ere na Amasia, omorwoti bw’Abayuda, bakarigererania obosio ase obosio ase okorwana esegi agwo Beti‐Semesi, omochie bw’Abayuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abayuda bakabugwa n’Abaisraeli, bagatama, kera omonto gochia ase enka yaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoasi, omorwoti bw’Abaisraeli, akabwatera Amasia, omorwoti bw’Abayuda, agwo Beti‐Semesi. Amasia nigo arenge mosinto o Yoashi bw’Ahasia. Yehoasi, omorwoti bw’Abaisraeli, akagenda Yerusalemu, agatagora orwaki rw’aroro ase obotambe bw’amaboko amagana ane, korwa Egeita gi’Efraimu goika Egeita gi’Ekoona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akaira chitaabu chionsi, ne chifeta, na ebikorero bionsi bianyorekanete ase enyomba y’Omonene, na ase chikungo chi’enyomba y’omorwoti, agoosa nabaanto abaarengeo. Erio akairana Samaria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono amang’ana ande onsi Yehoasi akorete, na okobua kwaye, na buna arwanete esegi n’Amasia, omorwoti bw’Abayuda, nigo ariikire ase Egetabu ki’ogokora kw’Abarwoti b’Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoasi akaraara ase chisokoro chiaye chiararete, agatindekwa agwo Samaria ase abarwoti b’Abaisraeli batindegetwe, na Yeroboamu, omwana oye omomura, akaba okogaamba ase ribaga riaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ogokwa kw’Amasia omorwoti bw’Abayuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(2 Amg 25:25-28)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amasia, mosinto o Yoashi, omorwoti bw’Abayuda, akagenderera koba moyo emiaka ikomi na etano magega y’ogokwa kwa Yehoasi, mosinto o Yehoahasi, omorwoti bw’Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono amang’ana ande onsi igoro y’Amasia nigo ariikire ase Egetabu ki’ogokora kw’Abarwoti b’Abayuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto bagakora omooroberio agwo Yerusalemu bw’ogoita Amasia, korende ere agatama gochia Lakisi. Abanto bagatomwa gochia Lakisi, bakamoitera aroro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakabogoria omobere oye ne chibarasi, bakayoira Yerusalemu, bakayotindeka aroro ase chisokoro chiaye chiatindegetwe, ase Omochie o Daudi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Abayuda bonsi bakabeeka Asaria akaba omorwoti ribaga ri’Amasia ise. Asaria nigo arenge nemiaka ikomi na etano nomo ekero keria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Amasia, omorwoti araire ase chisokoro chiaye chiaraarete, Asaria akaagacha Elati, naende akayoirania ase Abayuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeroboamu o kabere omorwoti bw’Abaisraeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase omwaka o ikomi na gatano bw’okogaamba kw’Amasia, mosinto o Yoashi, omorwoti bw’Abayuda, Yeroboamu, mosinto o Yehoasi, omorwoti bw’Abaisraeli, agachaaka kogamba agwo Samaria; ere akagaamba emiaka emerongo ene nomo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agakora ayare amabe ase obosio bw’Omonene; teatananete korwa ase ebibe biria Yeroboamu, mosinto o Nebati, akorete akagera Abaisraeli bagakora ebibe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akairania orogongo rw’Abaisraeli korwa ase egesoero kia Hamati, goikera ase Enyancha ya Araba buna Omonene, Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli, ateebete goetera ase omosomba oye Yona mosinto bw’Amitai, omobani oria orwete Gati-Heferi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene nigo aroche emechando y’Abaisraeli ng’a nemenene mono, ngochia koera bare bonsi, omosomba na oyo tari omosomba, naende monto onde tarenge ogokonya Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende Omonene konya tarateeba ng’a nasirie erieta ri’Abaisraeli korwa ase ense. Ase ayio akabatooria goetera ase okoboko kwa Yeroboamu, mosinto o Yehoasi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
